#usda 1.0
(
    doc = """DexHand EE — carve dexterous-hand colliders out of NonDexHand (PhysX).

CONVENTION (mounted dexhand self-collision)
==========================================
Parent articulation enables self-collision on BOTH rails:
  PhysX:  physxArticulation:enabledSelfCollisions = 1
  Newton: newton:selfCollisionEnabled = 1

PhysX mute: PhysicsCollisionGroup "NonDexHand" + filteredGroups self-filter
  W2:  payloads/Physics/body_self_collision_mute.usda  (physx subLayer)
  M6:  payloads/Physics/arm_self_collision_mute.usda   (physx subLayer)

Newton mute: collisionEnabled=0 on NonDexHand SHAPES (not CollisionGroup)
  W2:  body_self_collision_mute_newton.usda
       → append references on FiveAges_W2 Physics=mujoco (NO arm paths)
  M6:  arm_self_collision_mute_newton.usda
       → append references on M6_CCS Physics=mujoco
Reason: Newton lacks reliable filteredGroups; payload-subLayer mute loses to
base.usda Reference. Validate: W2/env/newton_verify_mute.py (authored=True).

link7 (or wrist) PhysX collection includes EXPAND into EE children. Without
excludes, finger colliders join NonDexHand, self-filter, and penetrate.
This EE sublayer ONLY prepends collection:colliders:excludes for dexhand roots
under tcp (PhysX path). Hands stay ungrouped → finger self-col + FilteredPairs.
Newton filteredPairs mute never lists LinkerHand bodies → same finger freedom.
Grippers (RG75, etc.) are intentionally NOT listed → remain muted (usually fine).

WHEN ADDING A NEW DEXHAND EE
----------------------------
1. Mount with root_joint active=false + FixedJoint (same tree as parent).
2. Sublayer this file from the EE usda (or append the new prim to excludes below).
3. Prim name under link7/tcp must match the exclude path.
4. On W2, also list both arms in body_self_collision_mute.usda excludes
   (PhysX). Newton mute lists do not include hands — no change needed there
   unless you add NonDexHand body links.

Current excludes: LinkerHand_o6, LinkerHand_o7 (extend list as needed).
"""
    metersPerUnit = 1
    upAxis = "Z"
)

over "M6_CCS"
{
    over "CollisionGroups"
    {
        over "NonDexHand"
        {
            # Remaps with the arm (→ Left_Arm / Right_Arm under W2).
            prepend rel collection:colliders:excludes = [
                </M6_CCS/link7/tcp/LinkerHand_o6>,
                </M6_CCS/link7/tcp/LinkerHand_o7>,
                # </M6_CCS/link7/tcp/YourDexHand>,
            ]
        }
    }
}
